  m_Text: 'Read the enemy intention before choosing an ability.


    Venom Strike builds poison. Serpent''s Bite consumes it for burst damage.

    Fade reduces incoming damage; watch its availability before you act.


    Choose an ability, then click the enemy. Press Esc to cancel targeting.'
